-- title:
--   Parabolic cohomology is free of rank two over the Hecke algebra
-- statement:
--   Let $N\ge 1$ and let $S\subseteq\mathbb{N}$ be a finite set containing no prime divisor of $N$. Write $\Gamma =$ [`CohCarrier.GammaH N ⊤`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L133), the image in $SL_2(\mathbb{Z})$ of the preimage of the full unit subgroup under [`CohCarrier.gamma0Units`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L121), i.e. $\Gamma_0(N)$, and let $V =$ [`ModularCurve.Period.parabolicHoms ℂ Γ ℂ`](def/ModularCurve_PeriodMap.html#L62) be the $\mathbb{C}$-submodule of the additive homomorphisms $\mathrm{Additive}\,\Gamma \to \mathbb{C}$ (the space [`CohCarrier.H1 N ⊤ ℂ`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L162)) consisting of those $\varphi$ with $\varphi(\gamma)=0$ for every $\gamma\in\Gamma$ whose matrix satisfies $(\operatorname{tr}\gamma)^2=4$. Let $\mathbb{T}\subseteq\operatorname{End}_{\mathbb{C}}(V)$ be the $\mathbb{C}$-subalgebra generated by those $T$ for which there is a prime $\ell\notin S$ with $T v =$ [`CohCarrier.heckeT N ⊤ ℓ ℂ`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L250) $(v)$ in [`CohCarrier.H1 N ⊤ ℂ`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L162) for all $v\in V$, where `heckeT` is the transfer operator built from the conjugation map [`CohCarrier.conjL`](def/CohCarrier_Level.html#L228). The assertion is twofold: first, there exists a basis of $V$ as a $\mathbb{T}$-module indexed by $\mathrm{Fin}\,2$, so $V$ is free of rank two over $\mathbb{T}$; second, for every $\mathbb{C}$-algebra homomorphism $\chi\colon\mathbb{T}\to\mathbb{C}$, the simultaneous eigenspace $\bigsqcap_{a\in\mathbb{T}}\ker(a-\chi(a))$ has $\mathbb{C}$-dimension exactly $2$.
--
--   This is the Hecke-module structure of the parabolic cohomology of $\Gamma_0(N)$ in weight two over $\mathbb{C}$: via Eichler–Shimura it corresponds to the freeness of rank one of $S_2(\Gamma_0(N))$ over the full complex Hecke algebra together with the multiplicity-one statement for algebra characters, doubled by the two-dimensionality of the period map. It is used in [`CohCarrier.finrank_cornerSubmodule_H1_eq_two_mul_of_not_isEisenstein`](thm.html#CohCarrier.finrank_cornerSubmodule_H1_eq_two_mul_of_not_isEisenstein) to compute dimensions of Hecke-eigen pieces of the cohomology carrier.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_CohCarrier_nonempty_basis_fin_two_parabolicHoms_and_finrank_eigenspace_eq_two.lean

